<title>ZIMBABWE: TENNIS-ZIMBABWE TAKE 3-0 WINNING LEAD OVER UKRAINE IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ZIMBABWE TAKE 3-0 WINNING LEAD OVER UKRAINE IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-02-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe took a winning 3-0 lead over Ukraine in their Davis Cup Euro/African zone group one first round tie after winning the doubles on Saturday.</p>
<p>Result:</p>
<p>Byron Black/Wayne Black beat Andrei Rybalko/Andrei Medvedev 7-6 (7-5) 4-6 6-1 6-4.</p>
</text>
